pr_comments:
@zeripath we want to do everything with PR's also tagging a release. 

At the moment when we want to build a tagged release we have to do after the PR merge in gitea, go back to cli, do a git pull, git tag, git push --tags (or of course do it via gitea) so that we can have the release tag in before the CI starts building it.

It can be a non-default option, it doesn't need to be always there if you think almost nobody has a usecase for this.

